pan></strong><span class="qwen-markdown-text"> aur logic likh kar de sakta hoon:</span></div><ul class="qwen-markdown-list" dir="ltr"><li class="qwen-markdown-list-item" dir="ltr"><strong class="qwen-markdown-strong" dir="ltr"><span class="qwen-markdown-text">Bowling Physics:</span></strong><span class="qwen-markdown-text"> Ball ki speed, swing, spin, aur pitch par bounce hone ka logic (Raycasting aur Rigidbody physics).</span></li><li class="qwen-markdown-list-item" dir="ltr"><strong class="qwen-markdown-strong" dir="ltr"><span class="qwen-markdown-text">Batting Mechanic:</span></strong><span class="qwen-markdown-text"> Timing meter (jaise </span><em class="qwen-markdown-em" dir="ltr"><span class="qwen-markdown-text">Real Cricket</span></em><span class="qwen-markdown-text"> ya </span><em class="qwen-markdown-em" dir="ltr"><span class="qwen-markdown-text">WWE</span></em><span class="qwen-markdown-text"> games me hota hai). Perfect timing, early, aur late hit ka logic.</span></li><li class="qwen-markdown-list-item" dir="ltr"><strong class="qwen-markdown-strong" dir="ltr"><span class="qwen-markdown-text">Fielding &amp; AI:</span></strong><span class="qwen-markdown-text"> Agar 3-4 players hain, toh kya sab batsman/bowler honge ya koi fielding bhi karega? Fielders ki AI movement ka code.</span></li><li class="qwen-markdown-list-item" dir="ltr"><strong class="qwen-markdown-strong" dir="ltr"><span class="qwen-markdown-text">Camera System:</span></strong><span class="qwen-markdown-text"> Bowler ke peeche ka camera, batsman ke shoulder ka camera, aur broadcast angle.</span></li></ul><div class="qwen-markdown-space"></div><h3 class="qwen-markdown-heading" dir="ltr"><span class="qwen-markdown-text">4. 3D Assets (Models &amp; Animations)</span></h3><div class="qwen-markdown-paragraph" dir="ltr"><span class="qwen-markdown-text">Game banane ke liye tumhe 3D cheezon ki zaroorat padegi. Main tumhe bata sakta hoon ki free/paid assets kahan se milenge:</span></div><ul class="qwen-ma